  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN264.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">1. paruvaṅ kaṇṭu vaṉpuṟaiyetiraḻintu talaimaka ṭōḻikkuc colliyatu. 2. tōḻi talaimakaṭkuc colliyatūumām.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">1. What SHE, being desolate in the face of consolation upon seeing the season, said to the confidante. 2. It is also what the confidante said to HER.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN264.1">
        <l>maḻaiyil vāṉa mīṉaṇin taṉṉa</l>
        <l>kuḻaiyamaṉ mucuṇṭai vāliya malara</l>
        <l>viriveṇ kōṭal vāṅkukulai vaṉpūp</l>
        <l>periya cūṭiya kavarkōṟ kōvala</l>
        <l>relluppeya luḻanta pallā ṉirai<supplied>yo</supplied>ṭu</l>
        <l>nīrtikaḻ kaṇṇiya<supplied>r</supplied> kāvayiṟ peyartara</l>
        <l>naṉicēṭ paṭṭa māri taḷiciṟan</l>
        <l>tērtaru kaṭunīr teruvuto ṟoḻukap</l>
        <l>pēricai muḻakkamoṭu ciṟantunaṉi mayaṅkik</l>
        <l>kūtirniṉ ṟaṉṟāṟ poḻutē kātalar</l>
        <l>nannilai yaṟiyā rāyiṉun ta<supplied>nni</supplied>lai</l>
        <l>yaṟintaṉar kollō tāmē yōṅkunaṭaik</l>
        <l>kāyci<supplied>ṉa</supplied> yāṉai kaṅkul cūḻa</l>
        <l>vañcuvara viṟutta tāṉai</l>
        <l>veñciṉa vēntaṉ pācaṟai yōrē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="2">When pure [flowers] blossom on the bindweed’s dense sprouts</l>
        <l corresp="1">like stars that adorn the cloudless sky,</l>
        <l corresp="6">while those with chaplets glittering with water return from the forest</l>
        <l corresp="5">along with the herd of many cows that had borne the rain for days,</l>
        <l corresp="4">the cowherds with [their] forked sticks, who wore the big ones</l>
        <l corresp="3">among the strong flower in bending bunches of the expanding white Malabar lily,</l>
        <l corresp="8">while rising speedy water flows in every street,</l>
        <l corresp="7">abounding in drops from showers that fell much in a distance,</l>
        <l corresp="10a-c">the time of the cool season has truly set in,</l>
        <l corresp="9">very perturbed, excelling with very loud  thunder.</l>
        <l corresp="10d-11c">Even if [our] lover doesn’t know about our state,</l>
        <l corresp="11d-12c">has he not understood his own state [either],</l>
        <l corresp="15">– he in the encampment of the king with hot anger,</l>
        <l corresp="14">with an army that camped, for fear to come,</l>
        <l corresp="12d-13">while elephants with high gait [and] hot anger surround [it] at night?</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

